From 959d92079c4fa0e508412610e8bb48b547ee1df8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: c4pp4
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:14:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] Sort photos from the newest

The photos in the Recent and My photos categories are sorted by their
comments, which start with the time. The default order is ascending, so
the oldest photos were displayed first.

Signed-off-by: c4pp4
---
 data/master-scopes/photos.scope.in.in | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/data/master-scopes/photos.scope.in.in b/data/master-scopes/photos.scope.in.in
index 13c7711..76d25f7 100644
--- a/data/master-scopes/photos.scope.in.in
+++ b/data/master-scopes/photos.scope.in.in
@@ -18,13 +18,13 @@ X-Ubuntu-Gettext-Domain=unity-scope-home
 _Name=Recent
 Icon=@prefix@/share/icons/unity-icon-theme/places/svg/group-recent.svg
 DedupField=uri
-SortField=comment
+SortField=comment::desc
 
 [Category mine]
 _Name=My photos
 Icon=@prefix@/share/icons/unity-icon-theme/places/svg/group-photos.svg
 DedupField=uri
-SortField=comment
+SortField=comment::desc
 
 [Category friends]
 _Name=Friends
-- 
2.56.1

